n衣装はそれぞれアレンジして頂いてもOKです。\nchiffon様にお任せします。\n\nリクエスト内容に差し支えなければ、よろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@airi_chiffon/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a04c8cd9/uploads/origins/f9f47c6f-74e0-4f3b-b08f-1ff0f0f7d3a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=113558a726a12a87ed60aeab7a05ad97", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a04c8cd9/uploads/origins/f9f47c6f-74e0-4f3b-b08f-1ff0f0f7d3a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=113558a726a12a87ed60aeab7a05ad97, https://si.imgix.net/a04c8cd9/uploads/origins/f9f47c6f-74e0-4f3b-b08f-1ff0f0f7d3a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=262bfc62bab6efc001a1d3d01fc8c2c6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a04c8cd9/uploads/origins/f9f47c6f-74e0-4f3b-b08f-1ff0f0f7d3a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a17f58a343c0552f0ddf16f2c5ea7d87 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "可愛い感じのイラストをお願いしたいです。透過素材でいただければ幸いです。おはＶやサムネイルなどに使用予定です。前髪あり、無し版どちらでも構いません\n\nhttps://x.com/jinojinray/status/1894194038104080769?t=H_W8zLPNCoJuQ2Bm-0E_0g&s=19\n\nhttps://x.com/jinojinray/status/1894194038104080769?t=H_W8zLPNCoJuQ2Bm-0E_0g&s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@airi_chiffon/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/33b839cb/uploads/origins/43e79a86-8b15-4449-8862-d1e9458ff079?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eded4c7b8871ade597a73349c3391ea5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/33b839cb/uploads/origins/43e79a86-8b15-4449-8862-d1e9458ff079?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eded4c7b8871ade597a73349c3391ea5, https://si.imgix.net/33b839cb/uploads/origins/43e79a86-8b15-4449-8862-d1e9458ff079?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de7087612bea1495f2882b0ccc0c1619 2x, https://si.imgix.net/33b839cb/uploads/origins/43e7